            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " is an annotation that can be applied to methods in integration test classes that need to register "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "dynamic"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "emphasis",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " properties to be added to the set of "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "PropertySources"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " in the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Environment"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " for an "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " loaded for an integration test. Dynamic properties are useful when you do not know the value of the properties upfront – for example, if the properties are managed by an external resource such as for a container managed by the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Testcontainers"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "link",
            "target": "https://www.testcontainers.org"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " project."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The following example demonstrates how to register a dynamic property:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
